{
  "_comment": "LLM provider list (centralized model provisioning, ADR-0042). Copy to configs/providers.json (gitignored) and edit. The `default` field is the id of the global default generator. The `roles` map assigns a generator id to each system-organ role (planner/verifier/router/memory/facts; the former `interview` role is retired and ignored if present). The `health` block tunes the per-id circuit-breaker. If both config.json and providers.json define an `llm_provider` block, providers.json wins. CAMBRIAN_LLM_PROVIDER__* env vars override this file. See ADR-0042 for the full schema. Per generator, `max_tokens` is the output cap sent when a request sets none (Anthropic defaults to 4096), `context_window_tokens` is the model's context window: when set, a request whose estimated prompt + output cap + `llm_provider.context_margin_ratio` (default 0.05) of the window does not fit is refused before sending (0 or absent = no check), `native_tools` enables native tool calling, and `request_capabilities` overrides what the adapter declares it honours (ADR-0139 C1): keys system_role, tools, tool_choice, parallel_tools, response_schema, max_tokens, sampling, stop, cache_breakpoints, images; values enforced | best_effort | unsupported. An unsupported field is not sent and is reported in the response's ignored list; a best_effort response_schema is validated and repaired once by the provider layer. The haiku-local entry below carries the values measured against the claudebox proxy on 2026-11-04.",

  "llm_provider": {
    "default": "primary",
    "generators": [
      {
        "id": "primary",
        "provider": "openai",
        "model": "<model-name>",
        "endpoint": "https://your-openai-compatible-endpoint/v1",
        "api_key_env": "OPENAI_API_KEY",
        "timeout_ms": 60000,
        "capabilities": ["reasoning", "code"]
      },
      {
        "id": "haiku-local",
        "provider": "openai",
        "model": "claude-haiku-4-5",
        "endpoint": "http://127.0.0.1:3131/v1",
        "timeout_ms": 120000,
        "context_window_tokens": 200000,
        "capabilities": ["reasoning", "code"],
        "native_tools": true,
        "request_capabilities": {
          "sampling": "unsupported",
          "stop": "unsupported",
          "response_schema": "best_effort",
          "max_tokens": "best_effort",
          "tool_choice": "best_effort",
          "parallel_tools": "best_effort",
          "cache_breakpoints": "unsupported",
          "images": "unsupported"
        }
      }
    ],
    "roles": {
      "planner": "primary",
      "verifier": "primary",
      "router": "primary",
      "memory": "primary"
    },
    "health": {
      "failure_threshold": 3,
      "cooldown_ms": 30000
    }
  }
}
